{"PANIC_DAY_GROUP","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh|day=0,2|mood=fear",{"Where's the kid?!","Danny! DANNY! Has anybody seen Danny?!","Stick together, all of you!","Count off, who's missing?","Don't split up! Whatever you do!","Who's got the baby?!","Everybody here? Is everybody HERE?","Don't stop for anything, just go!","I can't see everybody, I can't see everybody, I can't-","Don't wait, go, GO, I'll catch up, go on!","He was right behind me!","MARCUS! Marcus, where are you?","Don't go back for it, whatever it is, don't go back!","Quit pushing! Quit it, you're gonna knock somebody down!","Everyone shut up and LISTEN!","I said left! LEFT! Not that left, the other left!","Katie! Katie, over here, with Mommy, right now!","Wendell, wait, WENDELL, don't leave us!","Crystal! Crystal, look at me, not at that!","Brandon, no, BRANDON, back in the group!","Come on, we're not leaving anybody here","Don't scatter, don't scatter, they'll get you if you scatter...","Dad? Dad! Dad, are you still with us?!","Everybody in a line, a LINE, nobody out of the line!","Does anyone have a plan? ANYBODY have a plan?","Off the gravel, onto the grass, all of you!","The slowest one sets the pace, so we wait for them!","Eyes on me, everybody, I know the way!","Maaama! Mama, wait for us! MAMA!","Dad! Dad, keep up! Dad!","Verna! Verna, grab the little one, grab him!","We're leaving, everybody up, now, up!","Don't separate, don't! They go for the one who's alone!","Ellie! Ellie, over here, follow my voice!","Everybody get in a circle, a circle, around the kids!","Why's everybody stopping? Why's everybody STOPPED?","Come on, guys, come on, I don't want to lose anyone else!","Kids, if we get separated, go to the church, the church, remember?","Hank's gone, did Hank go back for something? HANK?","I lost Mom, I lost her - she was behind me, now she's not!","Stop! Stop! Everybody stop! Where's Josh?","Brother Wayne! Wait for the Hendersons!","Hurry... please!"}},
{"PANIC_DAY_GROUP","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh|day=0,4|mood=fear",{"Hold hands, everyone hold hands, don't let go!","Grandpa, keep up, GRANDPA!","Right up against me, closer than that","Don't leave her behind, we are not leaving her!","Nobody gets left, I'm counting!","Keep each other in sight, you hear me, in SIGHT!","Hands on the person in front, go, hands on their shoulders","Grab a sleeve, grab anybody's sleeve, just don't let go","Link arms, tight, like we're at church","Bunch up, tight, tighter, I need to count you","Don't you dare wander off!","One group, one, we're ONE group","Little ones in the middle, old folks in the middle, go","Slow down, slow down for Granny, she can't go that fast!","I HAD her hand, it was right here, and-","Someone's missing, count again!","We can't go back, we can't, I'm sorry","Stop crying, you're making it worse!","I'm not the leader, don't look at me","You decide, I can't, somebody else decide!","Which way? You tell me which way, I'll follow YOU!","I don't know, I'm just following the guy in front","Where's Tasha? Tasha was with us, she was with us a minute ago","Luis, hold your sister's hand - don't you dare let go!","Opal! OPAL! Slow down, she can't keep up, somebody get Opal!","Jolene's hurt her foot, we have to- somebody help Jolene","Cody, you're up front, take the lead","Heather, you're last, so you watch the back...","Rhonda, you've got the little ones, keep them in front of you!","Kenny, where's the water, who's got the water?","Little Dale's gone, did anybody see Little Dale go?","Darnell, you stay with your mama, you hear, right with her","Missy, honey, take my hand, I've got you","No one talk, nobody run, follow me, quiet!","Go slow, I said slow, we're not running, running's what they want...","Who's carrying the food? Somebody take the food, please...","Pick her up, somebody pick her up, she can't walk...","Where's Mom? Mom was right here!","Wait, wait, we left Grandma's pills, no, forget it, FORGET it","Count heads, I count seven, I should have eight!","Get behind the big guy, right behind him","Whoever's last, speak up, say something, are you there?","Call out your name, say your name, so I know you're here!","I can't hold on to everyone, I only have two hands!","We're a group, we don't leave anybody!","Oh Jesus, where did everybody go? Where did you ALL go?","Hey! Hey, you in the back, speed up!","No, we're NOT leaving Mr Pruitt, put his arm over your shoulder!","Take whoever's with you. Don't wait for me","Don't let anyone fall behind, please, don't let anyone","Jimmy Ray, so help me- JIMMY RAY, get over here!","Don't look at them, look at my back, just my back","Follow the red jacket, don't lose it","Stay where I can see you!","Anybody hurt? Say so now, say so right now!","Daddy's got the flashlight, stay where you can see Daddy's light","One, two, three... where's four? Who's four?!","She can't keep up, we can't wait, we have to wait, damn it all!","You carry the boy, I'll take the bag, no, drop the bag, DROP it!","Kids first, count the kids, one, two, three, four, good, now us","Breathe, in, out, in, out, c'mon, with me","I can't carry you AND the water, I can't, pick one!","We're splitting up, no, we're not, yes we are, NO we're NOT","Dolores, wait for Eugene, he's slow, WAIT for him!","Travis, where's your brother? Where is he, Travis?","Shawn? Shawn! Say something, make a noise, any noise","Mitch is gone, he just- he was just here, Mitch is gone","Hold on, I'm missing a kid - I've got four, there were five","Somebody has to stay with Mama, she won't walk","She says leave her, we're not leaving her","We lost somebody, I can't tell who!","Where are you? Say where you are, we can't see you!","Hang on to the rope, everyone hang on to the rope","Don't you let that boy out of your sight","Come back, don't go alone!","Hurry up, you're falling behind!","I can't see the back of the line!","Take his hand, take it, he's cold, he's shaking","Little legs, pick up the little ones, carry them","Please stay where I can see you, I'm begging you!","Please, don't leave me behind you!","Everybody say your address, in case we get separated, say it out loud!","Don't tell anybody where we're going, not anybody!","We're not stopping for anyone, don't ask me to stop","Sing in your head, children, sing it in your head, not out loud!","Stay in my footsteps, step where I step","Whisper, only whisper, whisper to the one beside you","Take turns on lookout, ten minutes each","Count the little heads, the little ones, one, two, three","I can't carry both, you take Joey, I'll take Amy!","Slow, slow, the baby's heavy, slow down","Don't let go of the stroller, don't let go, it's the only one we've got","Who has a watch? We need to know how long we've been walking","Tammy, count us, count everyone, I can't do numbers right now!","Hold on to the back of my shirt, whatever you do, hold on","Boys, you stay by your father, girls, you stay by me!","Don't hold my hand so tight, no, hold it tight, ohh I don't know..."}},
