{"PANIC_DAY_GROUP","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh,seasoned|day=0,4",{"Pair up, find a partner, hold their hand, no one walks alone","Eyes on the back of the head in front of you","Not the front, not the back, the middle's where you walk","Pass it back, we're stopping","Pass it back, it's clear, we're moving!","Pete, take Mr Odom's other arm","Radio check, anybody, one at a time!","Tight! Close it up, tight!","Rear, who's got rear? Rear, sound off","Rear's good, rear's all here","Hands in your pockets, touch nothing, not a peep","Fine, you lead, where are we going? ...exactly","Corinne, stay on my left, Hank, stay on my right","Gus, you're the tail, you tell me if anyone's missing!","Lorraine, take the hands of those two, keep them in the middle","Rosalee, you know the way, you lead","Collect your things, leave what you can't carry","Nobody out of arm's reach, understand, nobody","Group tight, kids inside, grown-ups on the outside","Count it out loud so I can hear you're all there","I don't want to hear a peep out of any of you","Tie yourselves together, belts, shoelaces, anything","Nobody leaves without telling me, nobody","Let's go, let's go, we're wasting time","Walk with someone, find someone, walk with them!","Does anybody know this area? Does anybody know where we are?","Turn around, let me look at all your faces","Rest if you have to, just within shouting distance of me","No one runs off, nobody, I'll hang a bell on every one of you","Hendersons, you're up front, we're in the middle, Pruitts bring up the back!","Walk on the grass, the gravel is loud!","Nobody sit down, nobody, I can't carry anyone who sits"}},
