{"PANIC_DAY_GROUP","reg=law,swat|day=0,2|mood=fear",{"Stick together! Everybody in the group!","Close it up, close it UP!","Where's Deputy Mullins? Mullins, report!","Hatcher! Where's Hatcher? HATCHER!","Hold the line, hold it!","Folks, one group, please!","I can't lose another one today!","I lost my partner, I lost him back there!","Wait! Wait for the slow ones, wait for them!","Don't scatter! If they scatter, they die!","Hey! You! Back in the group, back with the others!","Mrs Haskins! Over here! Stay with Mr Haskins!","Which of you is missing a kid? A kid's missing, which of you?","Slow down, Pruitt, you're losing the group!","Where's the old man? The old man in the green cap! Where is he?","Are we all here? Everybody sing out!"}},
{"PANIC_DAY_GROUP","reg=law,swat|day=0,4",{"Civilians in the middle, officers on the outside, go","Pruitt, you've got rear, you've got the rear","Keep them together, nobody wanders off","Behind me, in a line, single file","Count your people, call it out, I want a number","On me, on me, form on me","Hold your intervals, no bunching, no straggling","I need two on the left, two, now","Check your partner, call out","Pace yourselves, we're walking, we're not running","Last man, call it, tell me when you're clear","Who's missing? Somebody tell me who's missing","Two by two, partner up, hold your partner's belt!","Folks, if you lose sight of me, stop, stand still, I'll find you","Link up, hand on the shoulder in front!","Count at every stop, I want a number, loud","Pairs, folks, find a partner, don't walk alone","Wait at the corner, everyone wait, let me look!","Rear guard, report, are we all still together?"}},
{"PANIC_DAY_GROUP","reg=law,swat|day=0,4|mood=fear",{"Sound off! Everybody sound off!","No one breaks formation, nobody, not for any reason","Get me the radio, I've lost the radio!","Ma'am, stay with your group, please, stay with the others","Sir, I need you to stay with everybody else, sir","Nobody wander off, please, folks, please!","Mullins is down- no, he's up, he's up, MOVE!","Keep the kids between you, two adults to a kid!","Everybody still with us? Raise a hand, raise your hand","I can't count them all, there's too many, they keep moving around","I count three kids and I need to see three kids at all times!","Where'd the kid go? There was a kid, a little boy in a green shirt","I'm asking nicely, folks, stay with the group, please","Four of you with me, the rest follow, tight, tight","Does everyone have somebody beside them? Check!","Folks, if you can't see me, I can't see you, stay where I can see you!","Hold hands with the person next to you, please, I'm serious...","Who has water for the kids? Somebody pass water up","Sixteen of us left, I get fifteen now, somebody count again!","Don't talk, don't whisper, just follow","I'm going to need two deputies back there with the stragglers","One of you's missing, I can feel it, so nobody wanders!"}},
