{"PANIC_DAY_GROUP","reg=military,elite|day=0,4|mood=fear",{"Where's our medic? Where's the medic?","Civilians, behind us, not around us!","Lieutenant, I've got eleven of ours, maybe thirty of THEM!","I can't keep track of all of them, it's too many, they keep moving","Where's the kid? There was a kid, with a green backpack!","Does everyone have a weapon, everybody, even the cook...","Civilians in the middle, we form a box around them","Where's the lieutenant? Anybody seen the lieutenant?","Stay in the box, the box, don't leave the box","Where's the medic? We need the medic up front!"}},
{"PANIC_DAY_GROUP","reg=military,elite|day=0,4",{"Wounded in the middle, healthy outside, move","Check your people, check each other, count","We move as one, one man stops, everybody stops","Switch carriers every two hundred meters"}},
{"PANIC_DAY_GROUP","reg=military,elite|day=0,4|mood=grim",{"Tell the civilians to keep their kids close, closer than that","One at a time past the gap, nobody holds up the line"}},
{"PANIC_DAY_GROUP","reg=military,elite|day=0,4|mood=angry",{"Quit wandering, quit it, I will tie you to the next man if I have to","I said column, not a crowd, get in a COLUMN!"}},
