{"PANIC_DAY_GROUP","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|day=0,4|mood=fear",{"Who's driving? Somebody's gotta drive?","I'm counting heads, five, six, WHERE'S SEVEN?","Where's the money? Who's got the money?","Slow down, you're gonna lose the ones in back","Hey! Hey, Moe, you're falling behind, get up here!","Dale, Rick, Little Joe, Vince, Vince? VINCE?","I've got a bad knee, don't leave me, I can walk, watch me walk","Someone take the girl, take her, I can't carry her anymore","Count off, I said count off","Get Dale, somebody get Dale, he's still in there","We lost two, I'm sure we lost two, where did we lose two?","I can't see them, where'd they go","Everybody's here, right? Right?"}},
{"PANIC_DAY_GROUP","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|day=0,2|mood=fear",{"Everyone pile in, pile in!","Nobody goes anywhere alone, I'm serious, nobody","Billy's gone! Somebody go back!","I can't see the front! Who's up front?","Don't split up!","Hey! Where'd everyone GO?","Where's the kid? The kid was with us a minute ago...","Stay on my back, I'll get you through!","Wait for me, you sons of bitches, WAIT!"}},
{"PANIC_DAY_GROUP","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|day=0,4|mood=angry",{"Don't leave the stash, you idiot, GRAB THE STASH!","Take the cash, forget the rest, come ON","Pick a partner, pick one, I don't care who!","Hold hands, I don't care how it looks","Nobody's going back for Billy, move","Tighten up, tighten the hell up, we're a target!","Which one of you assholes lost the keys?","Hold it, where the hell do you think you're going?","Shut up and keep up, that's all I'm asking","Pick him up, we don't leave a man!","Jesus, you're like herding cats, tighten up!"}},
